## Capability

Insert or reseat parts in an explicit socket or breadboard contact group, then attach jumpers by endpoint. Keep wire shape editable separately.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Test the split rail, center gap, rotated device, occupied hole and insulated crossing against independently named contact groups. Reroute one jumper and retain its net.

